        "created_at": "2012-10-17T15:49:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Honetsly, I had only one problemw ith the original endings.</p><p>I'm annoyed about all the people who said the franchsie is the worst thing ever because of those last 10 minutes. The extended cut fixed things, but also made me feel dumb because everything was explained to me as though i were a child.</p><p>Shepard: \"so why would blah blah blah?\"&nbsp;</p><p>SPOILER: \"Because blah blah blah\".&nbsp;</p><p>ANd I agree with evandan55 that I believe in the indoctrination theory. It's uncanon, but it's cool.</p><p>Multiplayer is still so fucking addictive.&nbsp;</p>",
